  "description": "Only the best, forget the rest. Chad Kerley is a tech master with endless swagger and his\nsignature Haro CK Pro complete is built from the ground up to handle all Chad demands\nfrom a bike. All aftermarket everything, starting with the CK V3 frame and fork: Chad's signature frame with his own ultra-responsive geometry and personal touches of class. From there, you get Chad's signature bars and stem from Premium Products with an oversized 25.4mm clamping area for no-slip grip. Down below, you get Premium Trestle 24mm cranks, Team sprocket and Kinetic PC pedals. The wheel set comes complete with Varanyak 40mm wide rims, with sealed Team hubs including a freecoaster rear, with hub guards all sides, laced up with CK 2.4\" tires. You get a set of Premium PC pegs too. The CK Pro hangs with\nthe nicest custom builds out there, just as it sits.",
